{'symbol': 'FRC', 'date': '2022-02-17 09:00:00', 'title': 'FIRST REPUBLIC BANK ANNOUNCES TWO BOARD APPOINTMENTS', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIRST REPUBLIC BANK (NYSE:FRC), A LEADING PRIVATE BANK AND WEALTH MANAGEMENT COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THAT SHILLA KIM-PARKER, CEO & CO-FOUNDER OF ONLINE RETAILER THRILLING, HAS BEEN NAMED TO FIRST REPUBLIC BANK'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE TODAY. KIM-PARKER, 39, IS AN ENTREPRENEUR AND EXECUTIVE WHOSE BACKGROUND INCLUDES LEADERSHIP, OPERATIONS AND DIGITAL STRATEGY ROLES FOR DISNEY'S TELEVISION GROUP, LINCOLN CENTER FOR THE PERFORMING ARTS AND J.P. MORGAN. IN 2018,"}